    <reapack name="EA_Native_Automation.ext" type="extension" desc="EA Native Automation">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Compact Pro Tools-inspired automation panel for REAPER audio post-production. Windows x64 and macOS Intel/Apple Silicon universal native extensions with a matching Lua engine. Restart REAPER after installation. Run EA: Native Automation (JUCE) - toggle panel. Search EA: Automation for 104 individual shortcut actions. Preview/Capture, Manual Write, Write on Stop, Copy Send 1-10, copy/paste/fill, fixed-size docking and saved section visibility. The entire Preview button blinks green while active. REAPER theme colours and Inter fonts when available. Mac is a preview: compiled and model/installer checked; live REAPER Mac testing remains pending. Known track volume/pan Manual Write and envelope-visibility reports remain open. Linux source only. AGPL-3.0-or-later. Complete corresponding source and pinned dependency archives are linked below.\par}
}
]]></description>
