        <changelog><![CDATA[Windows x64 and universal macOS Intel/Apple Silicon native packages; restart REAPER after updating.
104 shortcut actions, separate Copy Send 1-10 and saved Show sections choices.
Fixed-size docking flow and exact compact size presets; clearer Inter font rendering when available.
